Title: "By"
Id: "970de05f-fd54-493b-9761-bf4f05f9e01d"

Text: "A `by:` justification item records a source or method with a required `comment:`.

```mlg-fragment
Justified:
. by: \"induction\"
  comment: \"The result follows from the recursive definition.\"
```

The content is open text and is not semantically checked as a proof."
Id: "6b21d2a3-e054-4f5d-ba9b-9911a87c41da"
